{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21753","headline":"乐府古题序 采珠行 · 元稹","name":"乐府古题序 采珠行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"海波无底珠沈海，采珠之人判死采。\n万人判死一得珠，斛量买婢人何在。\n年年采珠珠避人，今年采珠由海神。\n海神采珠珠尽死，死尽明珠空海水。\n珠爲海物海属神，神今自采何况人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21753.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21753","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}